  "question": "What gallery can I find within 190 kilometers in the forward direction toward Jurassic Park, Staten Island, NY?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.005072 40.713744)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.110544 40.594008)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.005072 40.713744)',4326)::geography, 190000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.005072 40.713744)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
